# Local development configuration.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and uncomment what you want to
# override. Every variable is OPTIONAL — anything left unset falls back to the
# default defined in src/config.ts (DEFAULT_CONFIG). QA/prod do not use this
# file; those environments set the variables through the deployment platform.
#
# The values below are the current defaults, shown for reference.

# HOST=0.0.0.0
# PORT=3000
# MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES=262144000   # 250 MiB; uploads larger than this get 413
# LOG_LEVEL=info               # fatal | error | warn | info | debug | trace | silent
